        <https://w3id.org/dartfx/semanticdt/r>,
        <https://w3id.org/dartfx/semanticdt/rust>,
        <https://w3id.org/dartfx/semanticdt/sas>,
        <https://w3id.org/dartfx/semanticdt/spss>,
        <https://w3id.org/dartfx/semanticdt/sql>,
